{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "8cb0b54b01a3b14859f3161fdcfe51fda1c2e9b747e3e34ae3b6f8a678505e70", "ja": "廻り出す†歯車†", "zh": "开始转动的†齿轮†", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8d3dfe39019d38a3da72314160b7eb45d4289ed2dd5c653d8de1c45c8591e5be", "ja": "耽美な世界観のユニットを組むことになった\n百合子達。好きなテーマに喜ぶ百合子とロコ\nだが、他のメンバーは世界観が想像できず、\n不安だと言う。そこで百合子は「私にまかせ\nてください」とプロデューサーに願い出る。", "zh": "百合子她们确定要组成发想自唯美世界观的\n团体，虽然百合子和ROCO很高兴是自己喜欢\n的主题，但其他成员想像不出这样的世界观而\n感到不安，这时百合子主动表示「交给我吧」\n并向制作人提出一个要求。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "032d4d4a21be09541200c6973f685d85f13eb5493eaee7f937b29f8adb98253e", "ja": "（今日は、ユニットの初ミーティングだ。\n新しい企画、みんな喜んでくれる……はずだ！）", "zh": "（今天是这个团体第一次开会。\n这个新企划，大家应该会喜欢……才对！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "7249eeff7ba45589cc018f042f701db49171b4d71fc5f39d6a188c5d6a6bb66c", "ja": "という訳で、この5人に組んでもらう新ユニットの\nコンセプトは、耽美、退廃、ゴシックロリータだ！", "zh": "综上所述，你们五人要组成的新团体的概念，\n就是唯美、颓废以及歌德风萝莉塔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "7482a381439f78dd1cb8b1a9e7a12e1a5682fe3fb4127ffbb6c5a24329c0c42c", "ja": "耽美……？", "zh": "唯美……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "2dcbc33cef6cc05d6dd88fef52cb5ce9f47c00dfba6ee1c305259c4af7c9aa78", "ja": "退廃……。", "zh": "颓废……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "a0d5cb16ec6166aa701b075106192c78bd328922aedbdb54a74227568dfc7796", "ja": "ゴシックロリータ……？\nって、何だ？　お菓子とか？", "zh": "歌德风萝莉塔……？\n那是什么？点心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1005_025roc", "source_sha256": "3e5d5a1677ce1b55ce1d01bc46d85903c19d5b9ba57a9af02d3bc0c2b0fc3e3f", "ja": "インタレスティングです、{$P$}！\nもっと詳しく聞かせてください♪", "zh": "Interesting，{$P$}！\n请再讲详细点♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "04d762881ad512c888d842fed5773d84050348af9b4bf12265de3f13b60cfd67", "ja": "あれ、百合子はあんまり興味ないか？\nこういうの、好きなのかと思ってたけど。", "zh": "奇怪，百合子你不感兴趣吗？\n我还以为你会喜欢这种主题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "d0965611edf2056d698f2104bc7488cd6241bf21387d01eaf9a2a0d6c3bcb21f", "ja": "す……。", "zh": "喜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b2c0cdc5a5fcfd7ab275f0a874419786cd39944411ce88f8f068c5df28ceb8f9", "ja": "す？", "zh": "喜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "97b028077c2137bf7986ab38ab30b523e933ea58d17d461e5606f2f2e351f935", "ja": "好きです！　直球です！　どストライクです！\nうれしすぎて、一瞬気絶しそうになってました……！", "zh": "喜欢！正中红心！爱得不得了！\n我差点高兴到要晕倒了呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "32f60cf8aae07c60d6ad6afde8f6f197f92fe2d1472e1c02395d286e359aeca1", "ja": "今までの妄想が、ふわーっと浮かんできて……\nあれ？　もしかして、これが走馬灯……？", "zh": "至今为止的幻想全冒了出来……\n奇怪？难道这就是死前的走马灯……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "77e24625ab0a5e23a533e2ed55720d9779cd606472ce4778cb656eca7b877d68", "ja": "そ、走馬灯はちょっと困るな……。\n無事に戻ってきてくれてなによりだよ。", "zh": "看、看到走马灯的话我会满伤脑筋的……\n幸好你有平安回神。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "ff82f407fcb7f21b6939c5b39402a4a3cc50ae73bb3102af8435ef40ca2cb695", "ja": "なー、{$P$}。さっきの、どういう\n意味なんだ？　百合子はわかってるみたいだけど……。", "zh": "欸，{$P$}，刚才你讲的那些，\n是什么意思啊？百合子好像很懂的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "0a5c3110daa74ddf012aa7bb9342dde2ece46f57cf4f4f9024281af0459e818a", "ja": "退廃、耽美、ゴスロリときたら、もう世界観は\n決まったようなものですよ、昴さん！", "zh": "提到颓废、唯美、歌德萝莉，\n这样世界观根本就已经很明显了啊，昴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "5def9f44553009b7ab93946c4e4350875b56c9a8a3d37bd3ebe046d0ccc99677", "ja": "運命の歯車、鳥籠の少女……呪われた鎖を\n自ら断ち切る刹那、彼女たちを待ち受けるものは……！", "zh": "命运的齿轮、笼中少女……在她们主动切断\n诅咒锁链的那一刹那，等着她们的是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "72af4a23cb695c039c211298f5d400022b070ecda5bdb604406f613fa5de4c5a", "ja": "ああっ、想像が無限に膨らんでいきます！\nもう、素敵すぎますよこんなの！　ズルいです！", "zh": "啊啊！我的想像正在无限膨胀！\n这真是太美妙了！太犯规了啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "fb53da4995d0ec21368bbde4e4048b5ef63b347c053f5579687a0cbcaeaad3b5", "ja": "大変です。七尾さんの情熱が止まりません。\nさすがは、劇場の誇る文学少女。……圧倒されたぞ。", "zh": "糟糕，七尾的热情一发不可收拾。\n不愧是剧场引以为傲的文学少女，气魄惊人啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "8a6fe071b07dfe6c450bc17b3c9aa54725f889d5548c72886fad0ea46c73d2cc", "ja": "百合子さん……こういうの、好きだから……。", "zh": "因为百合子……喜欢这类题材……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "ac397bfe1e34f16b73fddadd8ab45d7f9f92f7cb7a210457475f6a5ad589f69d", "ja": "うーん……。なんかオレ、\nイマイチよくわかんないんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯……我好像……\n对这些不是很了解耶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "b7af2c213c62b8ea3eb658eedd5e04aeab9d49c79042f01f6c5cc8f0f648d209", "ja": "ロコは、とってもアトラクティブだと思いました。\nエキサイティングですし、イノベーティブです！", "zh": "ROCO觉得这听起来非常Attractive，\n感觉既Exciting又Innovative！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1021_025roc", "source_sha256": "b16fe12285eadb74f367eeb491926c099168add8b2474f00e16344fe2268fd98", "ja": "アグレッシブなプロジェクトは、\nロコもフェイバリットですよ♪", "zh": "这种Aggressive的Project，\nROCO也很Favorite喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "48f438e78ce5e7855c03b65b40f8011377da9d134067e3ad6b0be38c9790721d", "ja": "実は、デモ曲もできてるんだ。これを聞けば、\n昴もイメージが掴みやすくなるんじゃないかな？", "zh": "其实新歌的DEMO也已经做好了。\n先听过一遍，昴也能比较容易抓到这个概念吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1024_026yur", "source_sha256": "ccf0f23fe1c4ea5c3f9d379e11e0c93d43f63a194515790081fee5335d52c20c", "ja": "わあ……♪", "zh": "哇……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1025_047sub", "source_sha256": "a9d337f7bc782b7921b8b92ef010aee461823cb30bfc1d63323f2b7441484385", "ja": "曲はいいけど、なんか歌詞がすごくないか？\n見たことない漢字とかあるんだけど……。", "zh": "曲子是很棒没错，但歌词是不是有点夸张啊？\n还有我从来没看过的字……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1026_047sub", "source_sha256": "9911a25f24b6ae1a46aacc98e7cc2c2e501f0122d60794c319405bd90fcc7cc2", "ja": "{$P$}、やっぱよくわかんないよ。\nオレ、この歌、歌えるようになるのかなぁ？", "zh": "{$P$}，我还是有听没有懂啊。\n我真的有办法唱好这首歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1027_p", "source_sha256": "9a245e9eaaee4d44704a5e33d5d2b23fba7352e5c5d9c76c6019dfbc286f7ba8", "ja": "そうか……うーん。\n昴、そんなに不安なのか？", "zh": "这样啊……嗯……\n昴，你这么担心啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1028_047sub", "source_sha256": "eddb8d1b5f43bc965a06ffe6a7b0e91bfac898ee7fb313221ee1fca7674abbf2", "ja": "だって、{$P$}もよく言うだろ？\n歌詞の意味を考えて、気持ちを想像して歌えって。", "zh": "因为{$P$}不是也常说吗？\n唱歌时要去思考歌词的涵义，去想像那个心境来演唱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1029_047sub", "source_sha256": "0013325c326235ea9e3339d449a6fea1171256991341a1a432053d8df7a63f06", "ja": "けどオレ、絶望とか闇とか、考えたことないからさ。\n想像しようがないっていうか……。", "zh": "但是我……从来没想过绝望、黑暗之类的事情，\n所以实在没办法想像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1030_026yur", "source_sha256": "2d21f23eafa87b171cbe66e37775547f4a413f5df371e58a6f6b8da9bf5f86b9", "ja": "けど昴さん、千鶴さんや朋花さんと一緒に\n『昏き星、遠い月』の公演には出演してたんじゃ？", "zh": "可是昴，你不是和千鹤姊还有朋花一起办了\n『昏暗之星，遥远之月』的公演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1031_047sub", "source_sha256": "46131f416fb407387ff9252e55d544e0625b53b74fd434e645bcc4d92dd973eb", "ja": "あれは、お芝居だったし。\nオレは不良の役だったからなー。", "zh": "那毕竟是演戏，\n而且我演的还是流氓。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1032_047sub", "source_sha256": "52236a24fa17845e679001d65b4b3e0e131c51742ba3f94edadb46976e953910", "ja": "オレは今回、みんなのおまけって感じかなー。\nもちろん、足を引っ張らないようにはするけど……。", "zh": "我这次……算是大家的附属品吧～\n当然，我会努力不扯后腿的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1033_044miz", "source_sha256": "7a8fcac9709e96734287e1afb1a74468b21a91166ec2456953fc9ae5383dce00", "ja": "そうですね……。正直言うと、私もすこし、\nハードルの高さを感じています。……どうしよう。", "zh": "嗯……老实说，我也觉得这难度有点高。\n……该怎么办才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1034_024ann", "source_sha256": "06d310e686d3f30f0c88d72f748b59e10c2ef7c288560d01076b9d15658b6411", "ja": "杏奈も……ちょっと、難しい……かも。\nこういうのは……やったこと、ない……。", "zh": "杏奈也觉得……好像……有点困难。\n毕竟从来没有……接触过这方面……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1035_026yur", "source_sha256": "34e996de8b3d70b0f5be8cdb661d32b7fcfe03b0be7f59deb2831bb957d90adf", "ja": "ええっ！？　わ、私はこういう世界観で、昴さんや\n瑞希さんや杏奈ちゃんを、見てみたいけどなぁ……。", "zh": "咦咦！？我、我很想看昴跟瑞希还有小杏\n在这种世界观里的样子呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1036_p", "source_sha256": "fe70d0fb9e9f00b64d2674bef61f28cdce5a5eeb660fc03a43e47f2ac4313030", "ja": "独特なコンセプトであることは確かだからな。\nさて、みんなが上手くこの世界観を掴むには……。", "zh": "不怪大家，这次的概念确实是相当独特。\n那么，该怎么让大家理解这个世界观呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1037_026yur", "source_sha256": "4d8885aac9ce829192e0580c04585f5fbb2e50e2298f74a64effa2ea0023831d", "ja": "わ、わかりました。{$P$}さん、\nみんな！　ここは私にまかせてください！", "zh": "我、我知道了。{$P$}先生、大家！\n这就包在我身上吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1038_026yur", "source_sha256": "0a2b9b4912ba97ca1c101855e6e7148c9d52cb8bd26735620a9c8dc81d68a6ea", "ja": "この曲の……いえ、このユニットの世界観は、\n私がみんなに伝えてみせます！", "zh": "这首歌……不对，这个团体的世界观，\n我会负责让大家明白的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1039_047sub", "source_sha256": "bc31269605148b81d0d7ba34c6410027579cf90eb01c05acc01c4291965894d0", "ja": "百合子？\nけど、伝えるってどうやって……。", "zh": "百合子？\n但你打算如何……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1040_026yur", "source_sha256": "b7abb453aab63dc107f2e1ba41478a3e28a313efc4f0968db0ae50409b52e501", "ja": "大丈夫です！\n時間はいくらでもありますよ、昴さん！", "zh": "不用担心！\n我们有的是时间啊，昴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1041_026yur", "source_sha256": "2bf4ea777ae988fdba6b1a12fdf57cf2fe1177c7b9c20d081a6c237ecd8d2a04", "ja": "{$P$}さん、私に時間をください。\nきっと、この世界をわかりやすく表現してみせます！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，请给我一些时间。\n我一定会用浅显易懂的方式表现这个世界的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1042_p", "source_sha256": "0b7a8d9d92f877f44e9dc5ac27b93c4dc2c60bc4ad3da1c3ac0053f053eecf9b", "ja": "そうか。……意欲は充分みたいだし、\nここは百合子の表現力に頼ってみるのもいいかもな。", "zh": "这样啊……既然百合子看起来干劲十足，\n那么仰赖看看你的表现能力，或许也不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1043_026yur", "source_sha256": "7376e8f58494c2b6d2bc97c1a90f1c78b18dc6357f19719e0d60d2a03e4e4e8c", "ja": "はい！　おまかせください！\n明日までに、形にしてみせます！", "zh": "是！包在我身上吧！\n我会在明天之前让它成形的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0094_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_01_1044_p", "source_sha256": "b521d1eca2f7c0ae4ada0208c9bfe7d12675270976f1f595e2068c57da4def56", "ja": "（好きなだけあって、百合子の熱意は相当だ。きっと\nみんなを耽美なる世界へと誘ってくれる……はずだ！）", "zh": "（面对喜爱的事物，百合子涌出了相当巨大的热忱。\n相信她一定能将大家带往那唯美的世界……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
